l":"ggG8wWesD7m_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(252,250,244);color:rgb(94,83,74);\">An amino acid that gives you smooth energy with zero caffeine. Your energy lasts the whole event and there's no crash after.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg51Whvnxps_text","label":"gg51Whvnxps_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(252,250,244);color:rgb(17,12,9);\">8 Oroxylin A</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggHAIPFnSrN_text","label":"ggHAIPFnSrN_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(252,250,244);color:rgb(94,83,74);\">A rare bark extract that sharpens your focus. You stay in the conversation instead of drifting out of it.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggL6yVhsBDk_text","label":"ggL6yVhsBDk_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(252,250,244);color:rgb(17,12,9);\">9 Rhodiola Rosea</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggQwV4ObaIp_text","label":"ggQwV4ObaIp_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(252,250,244);color:rgb(94,83,74);\">A root that helps your body handle stress. The longer you take it, the calmer you stay when things get tense.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gqrgXfUoujrwR_text","label":"gqrgXfUoujrwR_text","default":"the OUTGOINGco."},{"type":"html","id":"gcbzpodwHDjGW_text","label":"gcbzpodwHDjGW_text","default":"UP TO 4O% OFF + FREE SHIPPING ON YOUR FIRST ORDER"},{"type":"html","id":"gtZwYkxZjunZT_text","label":"gtZwYkxZjunZT_text","default":"\"I felt happier, calmer, and more confident & outgoing.\" - Pamela W."},{"type":"html","id":"gvKVzIwPChpom_text","label":"gvKVzIwPChpom_text","default":"Outty | Social Lubricant Powder"},{"type":"html","id":"gUZhRTCekJuPh_text","label":"gUZhRTCekJuPh_text","default":"FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS"},{"type":"html","id":"gKDLJjZBdloEp_childItem_0","label":"gKDLJjZBdloEp_childItem_0","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(245,238,224);color:rgb(36,26,51);\"><strong>Does it make you feel euphoric or high?</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gKDLJjZBdloEp_childItem_1","label":"gKDLJjZBdloEp_childItem_1","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(245,238,224);color:rgb(36,26,51);\"><strong>What does it feel like?</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gKDLJjZBdloEp_childItem_2","label":"gKDLJjZBdloEp_childItem_2","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(245,238,224);color:rgb(36,26,51);\"><strong>I've tried supplements before. They never do anything.</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gKDLJjZBdloEp_childItem_3","label":"gKDLJjZBdloEp_childItem_3","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(245,238,224);color:rgb(36,26,51);\"><strong>Is there kava or kratom in it?</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gaccordion-item-body-text-i2l1ac1f367e9_text","label":"gaccordion-item-body-text-i2l1ac1f367e9_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(245,238,224);color:rgb(123,114,136);\">No. Outty does not get you high, and it does not give you a buzz. It does not work the way alcohol, opioids, or THC work. You feel like yourself, just without the nervousness.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gaccordion-item-body-text-i2l583d4a29b6_text","label":"gaccordion-item-body-text-i2l583d4a29b6_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(245,238,224);color:rgb(123,114,136);\">You feel less than you expect, and that is on purpose. You do not feel buzzed, sloppy, or altered. You feel like yourself, just without the nervousness. Customers describe it as feeling like themselves on a good day.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gaccordion-item-body-text-i2l62ad141f61_text","label":"gaccordion-item-body-text-i2l62ad141f61_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(245,238,224);color:rgb(123,114,136);\">Most supplements give you one ingredient at a small dose. Outty gives you nine ingredients at full doses. For example, it has 1,000mg of L-Theanine, and most products use less than 200mg. Every ingredient and every dose is printed on the label, so you can check them yourself. And if it still does nothing for you, you get your money back with the 60-day guarantee.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gaccordion-item-body-text-rewrap_row_xgLUDyPHpqqZ_text","label":"gaccordion-item-body-text-rewrap_row_xgLUDyPHpqqZ_text","default":"<p><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(245,238,224);color:rgb(123,114,136);\">No kava, no kratom. Nine active ingredients, all printed on the label: amino acids like L-Theanine and Taurine, plant extracts like Rhodiola and Mucuna, and GABA.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggCRP-gVbyd_childItem_0","label":"ggCRP-gVbyd_childItem_0","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(245,238,224);color:rgb(36,26,51);\"><strong>Is there caffeine in it?</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggCRP-gVbyd_childItem_1","label":"ggCRP-gVbyd_childItem_1","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(245,238,224);color:rgb(36,26,51);\"><strong>Will it keep me awake if I take it at night?</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggCRP-gVbyd_childItem_2","label":"ggCRP-gVbyd_childItem_2","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(245,238,224);color:rgb(36,26,51);\"><strong>How long does it last?</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggCRP-gVbyd_childItem_3","label":"ggCRP-gVbyd_childItem_3","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(245,238,224);color:rgb(36,26,51);\"><strong>What does it taste like?</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggCRP-gVbyd_childItem_4","label":"ggCRP-gVbyd_childItem_4","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(245,238,224);color:rgb(36,26,51);\"><strong>What do I mix it with?</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggCRP-gVbyd_childItem_5","label":"ggCRP-gVbyd_childItem_5","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(245,238,224);color:rgb(36,26,51);\"><strong>Can I just buy one bag without subscribing?</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggCRP-gVbyd_childItem_6","label":"ggCRP-gVbyd_childItem_6","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(245,238,224);color:rgb(36,26,51);\"><strong>Is the 40% off just my first order?</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggEVP1AZiDZ_text","label":"ggEVP1AZiDZ_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(245,238,224);color:rgb(123,114,136);\">No. Outty has zero caffeine and no stimulants. The energy you feel comes from natural ingredients.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggQQ7uob9d0_text","label":"ggQQ7uob9d0_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(245,238,224);color:rgb(123,114,136);\">No. There is no caffeine and there are no stimulants in it, so it will not keep you up. You can take it for an evening event and go to bed at your normal time.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggTYJlmcXyG_text","label":"ggTYJlmcXyG_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(245,238,224);color:rgb(123,114,136);\">One packet lasts about 3 to 4 hours. That covers most events from start to finish. It wears off on its own, and there is no crash.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggNSkDJBlL7_text","label":"ggNSkDJBlL7_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(245,238,224);color:rgb(123,114,136);\">It tastes like acai mixed berry with a slightly bitter finish. The bitterness comes from the active ingredients. They have a taste at full doses, and hiding that taste completely would mean using smaller doses. It tastes best mixed in cold water over ice. One reviewer compared it to a wine cooler.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg24wtKM0mQ_text","label":"gg24wtKM0mQ_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(245,238,224);color:rgb(123,114,136);\">Cold water over ice works best. You can also mix it with sparkling water, lemonade, your favorite juice, or a soda. There is no wrong way to mix it. If you want it to feel like your going-out drink, pour it in a nice glass.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggVmeVjnSgn_text","label":"ggVmeVjnSgn_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(245,238,224);color:rgb(123,114,136);\">Yes. You can make a one-time purchase, and the option is right under the subscribe button. The 60-day guarantee applies to both.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggdiiiqWZGd_text","label":"ggdiiiqWZGd_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(245,238,224);color:rgb(123,114,136);\">Yes. The 40% discount applies to your first subscription order. After that, your renewals are $59.99. You can pause, skip, or cancel your subscription anytime from your account.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gjDppPEhTTCmd_text","label":"gjDppPEhTTCmd_text","default":"SIGN IN"},{"type":"html","id":"glLiTkPEZLYMT_text","label":"glLiTkPEZLYMT_text","default":"BAG"}],
